## Scope

The MIT licence above covers this repository's source code. Test fixtures under
`actors/*/tests/fixtures/` are trimmed captures of third-party feeds or synthetically
generated files kept for offline parser tests; the facts in them are not our work and we
grant no rights in them. Product, league, team and company names are their owners'
trademarks. If you hold rights in anything here and want it removed, see `TAKEDOWN.md`
(48 hours, no argument).
